load @term/seed/machine/turing
  find turing-machine

# An algorithm: a finite, definite, effective procedure for solving a problem, a recipe a machine can follow without
# insight. The Church-Turing thesis says every algorithm is realizable by a Turing machine, and complexity theory ranks
# algorithms by the resources they consume. The substrate's collide-then-stream rule is an algorithm the universe runs.
# The form carries the machine the algorithm runs on.
form algorithm
  link machine, like turing-machine
